Subject: Re: [brainGraph-help] Column/row orders of own conmat matrix - should it match with the atlas rois order?
Message-ID: <6Cn19Y5xzTU.SV4aFzlABQAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <6Cn19Y5xzTU.bo-n9233AAAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
References: <6Cn19Y5xzTU.bo-n9233AAAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
